                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="29383600" author="robertaw" created="Mon, 9 Mar 2026 21:06:35 +0530"  >&lt;p&gt;Approved for 2026.1&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="29369381" author="tdorau" created="Fri, 6 Mar 2026 20:05:08 +0530"  >&lt;p&gt;Note: the scope listed in previous comment will close critical gaps and will complete Phase 1 of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/open-edge-platform/scenescape/blob/main/docs/adr/0009-tracking-evaluation.md&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;ADR 9: Tracking Evaluation Strategy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="29369375" author="tdorau" created="Fri, 6 Mar 2026 19:57:52 +0530"  >&lt;p&gt;The planned scope for 2026.1 release includes:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Design:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;extending the design to support pluggable similarity scoring in addition to Euclidean distance (2D IoU projected to the scene, Euclidean distance, in future 3D IoU and various shapes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Implementation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;adding jitter metrics,&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;unification of data formats and addressing review feedback from 2026.0 MVP version&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;CI workflows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Add threshold-based evaluation of the new metrics to CI (tracking quality degradation gating Pull Requests)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Evaluation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;evaluation of legacy tracker implementation with time-chunking enabled vs disabled&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;evaluation of new Tracker service vs legacy implementation (time chunking enabled / disabled)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
